<title>INDIA: India's BPCL board to meet on Friday.</title>
<headline>India's BPCL board to meet on Friday.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of India's state-run refining firm Bharat Petroleum Corporation Ltd (BPCL) will meet on Friday, September 27, a company spokesman told Reuters.</p>
<p>He did not give any details but analysts expect the company to decide on the timing and other details of a proposed public issue of shares to raise over 4.0 billion rupees.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
